<br>格局方正大空間，採光好，全新裝潢，你一定會喜歡，在這裏，就是你的幸福空間！<br><br>歡迎來電，提早預約看屋時間喔！。<br><br>請記得攜帶您的名片或識別證，讓我們更能認識您！</p>\r\n附近有便利商店。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "汐止區茄苳路276號", "lat": "25.0678558", "lng": "121.6721268", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "茄苳腳(茄安街口)站", "distance": 15, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約15公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "茄安街口[新巴士]站", "distance": 23, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約23公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "活力社區站", "distance": 146, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約146公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "Happy - 黑皮選物販賣、娃娃機", "distance": 1361, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1361公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "緣速食早點", "distance": 34, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約34公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "市立崇德國小補校", "distance": 353, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約353公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市立秀峰高級中學", "distance": 1157, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1157公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "16,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "網路、第四台", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋未辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "12坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "-", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "電梯", "value": "無", "key": "lift", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "隔間材料", "value": "輕材料", "key": "spacematerial", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "裝潢程度", "value": "高檔裝潢", "key": "decorate", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "裝潢時間", "value": "半年內", "key": "decorate_time", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "其他特色", "value": "新上架、隨時可遷入、可開伙、可養寵物", "key": "tags", "alias": "", "cate": 2}]}, "linkInfo": {"avatar": "https://img2.591.com.tw/user/2020/05/03/158846473933958408.jpg!100x10